{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nk9mxxtbHeLQYESkKxJGrw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:28.770917+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nk9mxxtbHeLQYESkKxJGrw","html":"<div><section><p><span>西北大学2026年招收推荐</span><strong><span><span>免试研究生</span></span></strong><span>工作即将开始，有望获得所在本科院校推荐资格且有意申请推荐免试攻读我院研究生的同学，请登录</span><strong><span><span>“西北大学推免生预报名系统”</span></span></strong><span>进行报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span> 一、学院简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span> “十四五”期间，我国“双碳”人才缺口以百万计，市场需求巨大，就业前景广阔。国家双碳 “1+N”政策体系顶层设计要求：建设碳达峰、碳中和人才体系，鼓励高等学校增设碳达峰、碳中和相关学科专业，建设一批绿色低碳领域未来技术学院。教育部印发的《加强碳达峰碳中和高等教育人才培养体系建设工作方案》中明确要</span><strong><span><span>加快碳捕集、利用与封存，碳金融和碳交易，储能和氢能相关紧缺学科专业建设和人才培养。  </span></span></strong><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span> 2021年5月9日，西北大学与榆林市人民政府启动共建</span></span><strong><span><span>西北大学榆林碳中和学院</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><span>这是全国首家服务应对气候变化，培养碳达峰碳中和领域急需高层次人才的新型研究型学院。学院</span><span><span>遵循</span></span><strong><span><span>“面向未来、创新引领、产教融合、独树一帜”</span></span></strong><span><span>的人才培养理念，</span></span><span><span>聚焦</span></span><span><span>碳捕集利用与封存、化石能源清洁高效利用、氢能与储能、矿山生态修复与大宗固废处理、生态碳汇、碳市场与碳金融</span></span><span><span>等重点研究方向，培养具有国际视野、产业认知、基础扎实、多学科交叉背景的复合型人才。</span><span><span>学院作为</span></span><strong><span><span>独立招生单位，</span></span></strong><span><span>独立进行课程体系和教学方案制定，以及</span><span><span>学生的教育管理</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>设置</span></span><strong><span><span>“碳储科学与工程”“绿色低碳发展与治理”</span></span></strong><span><span>两个交叉学科，</span></span><span><span>推出《碳中和概论》系列课程，</span></span><span><span>组织编写《二氧化碳封存与监测》《绿色低碳发展与治理》《全球气候治理与合作》</span><span><span>《碳资产管理》</span></span><span>等碳中和系列教材，</span></span><span><span>牵头组建</span></span><span><span>全国高校碳中和人才培养联盟、陕西省碳达峰碳中和标准化技术委员会、陕西省高等教育学会双碳专业委员会</span></span><span><span>，持续推进学科</span><strong><span>交叉融合、科教融合、产教融合、校地融合</span></strong><span>协同发展新模式，</span></span><span><span>为碳中和未来技术攻坚和产业提质扩能储备人才力量。</span></span></span></p></section><section><section><span><span><span>学院依托全校</span></span><strong><span><span>6个</span></span></strong><span><span>国家级科技创新平台和</span></span><strong><span><span>20个</span></span></strong><span><span>省部级平台，整合来自全校</span></span><strong><span><span>11个</span></span></strong><span><span>院系的教师组建高水平的研究团队。现有硕博士研究生导师</span></span><strong><span><span>109人</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span><span>4年来累计招收硕博士研究生</span><span>217人</span><span>，2025年首届毕业生去向落实率</span><span>100%。</span></span><span><span>“陕西省碳中和技术重点实验室”“应对气候变化和碳捕集利用与封存产业技术协同创新中心”“二氧化碳捕集、利用与封存学科创新引智基地”“二氧化碳捕集利用与封存技术未来产业创新研究院”</span></span><span><span>等多个省级平台相继获批，</span><span><span>入选首批</span></span><span><span>秦创原总窗口校地协同创新基地</span></span><span>。学院首席科学家</span></span></span><span><span>马劲风教授牵头申报的《十万吨级二氧化碳地质封存科学研究设施及碳捕集与封存示范工程建设项目》入选国家发改委</span></span><strong><span><span>“绿色低碳先进技术示范工程”，</span></span></strong><span><span>为陕西省唯一入选项目。学院</span></span><span><span>不断探索科技创新与人才培养</span></span><strong><span><span>“双轮驱动”</span></span></strong><span><span>的建设模式，该模式入选国家发改委、全国干部培训教材编审指导委员会办公室组织编写的</span></span><strong><span><span>《碳达峰碳中和案例选》</span></span></strong><span><span>，也是陕西省唯一入选案例。</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.2026届普通全日制本科毕业生，取得本科所在学校的推免资格。</span></p><section><span>2.具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会主义信念坚定，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上，身心健康。</span></section><section><span>3.勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀；学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></section><section><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></section><section><span>5.品行表现优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></section><section><span>6.在本科阶段公开发表过学术论文或在国内外重大竞赛中获奖者可优先考虑。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、招收计划</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span> 2026年，我院拟接收推荐免试硕士研究生30人，实际招生人数以录取人数为准。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、招收专业</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szV7h9IJdaibcWmm1ZibNvDUJZ3O7NLph0108db7u4OTGTKo7p1J1b7qhQ7PUVmEcypb2nZQU4Lyic9GZww1nbNeA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、导师简介</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>     师资队伍简介链接：</span></p><p><span><span>https://tzhxy.nwu.edu.cn/szdw/sztd.htm</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、申请方式</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）预报名：2025年9月1日—9月18日，申请人登录“西北大学推免生预报名系统”进行网上预报名。</span></p><section><span>西北大学推免生预报名系统链接：</span></section><section><span><span>https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10697/user/login/login?type=loginout</span></span></section><section><span>（二）院（系、所）通知复试：院（系、所）对推免生的报名信息进行初审，确定复试名单，向申请人发放复试通知。请考生关注所报学院的官网并保证电话畅通。</span></section><section><span>（三）考生参加复试，院（系、所）确定拟录取名单。</span></section><section><span>考生复试时需提供的材料：</span></section><section><span>1.学生证、身份证原件。</span></section><section><span>2.加盖学校教务部门公章的成绩单。</span></section><section><span>3.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等）和获奖证书。</span></section><section><span>4.外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试、托福、雅思、PETS等成绩单）。</span></section><section><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等证明。</span></section><section><span>6.其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></section><section><span>（四）待“教育部推免服务系统”开通后，被拟录取的推免生需登录“教育部推免服务系统”进行注册，并按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿。我校将在“教育部推免服务系统”中发放复试通知和拟录取通知。</span></section><section><span>(五)未进行预报名的同学在”教育部推免服务系统“开通后可进行报名。学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以届时通知为准。</span></section><section><span>（六）我校2026年招生目录将于2025年9月中旬公布，相关专业可参考《西北大学2025年硕士研究生招生专业目录》。</span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaiaLtHeubkd7wibOreP7YXxMCUYxGTF6wZYztmhNlCDeSQ7y9IIS2YFozz57NjN73g00IqPdBLgAvaDAyQmTAFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、联系方式 </span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>   </span><span><span>联系人：孟老师 王老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>   联系电话：029-88302102   </span></span><span><span>029-88302100</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"daa53ee819cd8bc9c58e2d3cac7b548ac6ac9b1fc6a5941f71480ff3ca3b4394","textLength":2087,"sourceSha256":"6de21404551aa1fa2bc9fa310dd9dd76aede0fb6bed87643c6c39f2b7744d138","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b640f2eb1b5fea89b1a4","title":"2025年西北大学碳中和学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:28.770917+00:00"}
